This code can only be used once and expires on {{ expires_at }}.

1. Exchange the code for an authentication token (JWT):

    curl -X POST {{ api_url }}/user/reset/consume \
      -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
      -d '{"token": "{{ token }}"}'

2. Get your user id, using the JWT from the response:

    curl {{ api_url }}/user/me \
      -H 'Authorization: Bearer <jwt>'

3. Set your new password:

    curl -X PATCH {{ api_url }}/user/<id> \
      -H 'Authorization: Bearer <jwt>' \
      -H 'Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json' \
      -d '{"password": "<your new password>"}'
